class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Dreamlike Constellation Worldview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you continue to face challenges, a more dreamlike world of stars unfolds.<br>Embark on a shining journey and explore a unique world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'The Examination Hall of Stars'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334400/extras/16afb8bda48dade38c62083b1c6e0174.avif?t=1740816514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> 'The Tomb of Stars'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334400/extras/c8e79b24fc701e4d7d52ec3f5f63a2c0.avif?t=1740816514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'The City of Scattered Stars'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334400/extras/95af3e1974882fab35c3abbb0ce3625c.avif?t=1740816514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>'Gort's Altar'</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3334400/extras/2e6df5a570007cc934bf08c7e207bf68.avif?t=1740816514\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
